a-range')).toBe(false);\n    expect(resolver.validRange('abc.def.ghi')).toBe(false);\n  });\n\n  it('resolve handles multiple plugins with dependencies', () => {\n    const constraints = [\n      { name: 'core', range: '^1.0.0' },\n      { name: 'utils', range: '^2.0.0' },\n      { name: 'logger', range: '>=1.5.0' },\n    ];\n    const available = {\n      core: ['1.0.0', '1.3.0', '2.0.0'],\n      utils: ['2.0.0', '2.1.0', '3.0.0'],\n      logger: ['1.0.0', '1.5.0', '1.9.0', '2.0.0'],\n    };\n    const result = resolver.resolve(constraints, available);\n    expect(result).toHaveLength(3);\n    expect(result.find(r => r.name === 'core')!.version).toBe('1.3.0');\n    expect(result.find(r => r.name === 'utils')!.version).toBe('2.1.0');\n    expect(result.find(r => r.name === 'logger')!.version).toBe('2.0.0');\n  });\n});\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
